SOFTWARE-SPECIFIC CAVEAT (operator decision 2026-10-14, atomic mirror):

CC BY-NC 4.0 is technically designed for cultural works (text, images,
audio, video). For software, PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0 is
a more conventional choice because it is written specifically for
source code and explicitly enumerates permitted non-commercial uses.

The operator (Choi Vis 2026-10-14) explicitly chose CC BY-NC 4.0 over
PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 for this directory. The choice is
preserved as-is; consumers of this code who require a software-tailored
non-commercial license should request a separate license from the
copyright holder.

